      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "骏大祭祈愿着赛马娘界的日益发展。她希望后来人能够充分继承骏大祭\n以及其中的仪式，进一步发扬骏大祭的优良传统――",
      "source_fingerprint": "9025290e3950c2682eb5bf2579a899f04632e6fa9dcea262373b5a575ef03a06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0030/storytimeline_090030005.json",
      "json_path": [
